## How It Works

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[".gitmodules<br/>(branch = release/X.Y.Z)"] --> C
    B["content/api/ scan<br/>(dirs not in .gitmodules)"] --> C
    C["sync-versions.ts"] --> D["lib/versions.ts"]
    C --> E["source.config.ts workspaces block"]
    C --> F["lib/source/index.tsx SYNC block"]
    E --> G["fumadocs-mdx"]
    G --> H[".source/5.2.0/server.ts"]
    G --> I[".source/5.1.0/server.ts"]
    H --> J["apiSources in index.tsx"]
    I --> J
```

**Discovery rules:**
- `branch = release/X.Y.Z` in [.gitmodules](file:///d:/_Projects/06_PSJ-Docs/psjnext/.gitmodules) → **frozen** (`sourceType: 'git'`)
- `content/api/<dir>` not in [.gitmodules](file:///d:/_Projects/06_PSJ-Docs/psjnext/.gitmodules) → **latest** (`sourceType: 'local'`)

